  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding Resource and Support Hub Programme: Evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to evaluate the performance of the RSH programme to date,  to determine how far the RSH programme has achieved expected results, analyse the value for money of the programme and capture key lessons and learning. The output will be used to inform future FCDO programming in relation to safeguarding against SEAH, and wider capability building.</narrative>
  </description>
